# T5 Dialogue Summarizer

An NLP project that uses a fine-tuned T5 (Text-to-Text Transfer Transformer) model to generate concise summaries from conversational dialogues.

## Features
- Dialogue preprocessing and cleaning
- Fine-tuned T5 model using the SAMSum dataset
- FastAPI backend for inference
- Simple web interface for submitting dialogues and viewing generated summaries
- Text Summarization

## Tech Stack
- Python
- PyTorch
- Hugging Face Transformers
- T5
- FastAPI
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript

## Project Status
Learning project – actively developing and improving.

## Future Improvements
- ROUGE and BERTScore evaluation
- Model performance optimization
- Improved summary quality
- Deployment and API improvements